---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Day Zero | AI Global Initiative" description="Watch the Day Zero scenario briefing.">
  <main id="main">
    <a href="/">AI Global Initiative</a>
    <h1 class="display">Day Zero</h1>
    <iframe
      title="Day Zero scenario video"
      src="https://player.mediadelivery.net/embed/816973/f82fed04-fd7d-4398-9f7a-fa1bc06271a5?autoplay=false&loop=false&muted=false&preload=true&responsive=true"
      allow="accelerometer; gyroscope; autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen"
      allowfullscreen
    ></iframe>
    <section class="situation-summary" aria-labelledby="situation-heading">
      <h2 id="situation-heading">The situation at a glance</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Hospitals across northern England have halted all but emergency blood transfusions. Around 4,000 blood samples may be affected, and patients are being recalled for tests.</li>
        <li>More than 250,000 routine payments have been frozen. The affected hospital and payment systems run at British Compute.</li>
        <li>British Compute had expected services to recover overnight. The cause and full extent of the disruption remain unknown.</li>
        <li>Frontier Labs, a major British Compute customer, has announced promising results for AI-designed cancer vaccines and says its next model will transform personalised medicine.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 68rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem) var(--gutter);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }

  iframe {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border: 0;
    background: var(--navy);
  }
  .situation-summary {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    max-width: 70ch;
  }

  .situation-summary h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .situation-summary ul {
    padding-left: 1.4rem;
    list-style: disc;
  }

  .situation-summary li + li {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
